  "body": "Offering an enviable combination of space, sunshine and effortless living, this beautifully presented apartment is the perfect lock-up-and-leave opportunity.\r\nBoasting over 90sqm of thoughtfully designed living, including a generous 19sqm covered deck, the sunny west-facing aspect captures the afternoon sun beautifully. Immaculately presented and ready to enjoy, there's nothing to do but move in, relax and embrace the lifestyle.\r\nThe spacious open-plan living area features full-height glazing and a refined kitchen with quality cabinetry and premium Miele appliances. The generous master bedroom opens directly onto the deck, while a fully tiled bathroom with underfloor heating, concealed laundry and excellent storage complete the picture.\r\nSecure basement parking, a substantial storage locker and convenient lift access add to the appeal. No stairs, no garden maintenance and no weekend chores - simply lock up and leave, travel with ease or enjoy more time doing the things you love.\r\nKensington Park offers a wonderful resort-style lifestyle, with an indoor heated pool, gym, on-site café and beautifully landscaped grounds. Particularly lovely in spring, the gardens are alive with colour and abundant birdlife. Orewa Beach is just a 450m stroll away, with village shops, restaurants and coastal walkways all close at hand.\r\nHaving purchased off the plans three years ago, the vendors have thoroughly enjoyed calling Kensington Park home and leave with genuine reluctance, but have decided the time has come to move on.\r\nA wonderful opportunity to secure an immaculate, sun-filled apartment in one of New Zealand's most sought-after freehold coastal neighbourhoods. Simply move in and enjoy!\r\n\r\nCall Tonia today to view this exceptional home.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty Ltd is Licensed REAA 2008",
